Item.ДекорацияОсобенностиРаботыPsql.Title=The information is obtained using the <b>psql</> console utility from the PostgreSQL package. \nInformation on the <link https\://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/app-psql.html>https\://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/app-psql.html</> utility\nYou can download it from here <link https\://www.postgresql.org/download>https\://www.postgresql.org/download/</>\nIn the 1C version of PostgreSQL, the utility is included. It is usually located in the <b>bin</> directory of the installation directory <fontsize 12><b>PostgreSQL</></>
Item.ДекорацияОсобенностиРаботыSqlcmd.Title=The information is obtained using the <b>sqlcmd</> console utility from the MsSQL package\n<link https\://learn.microsoft.com/ru-ru/sql/tools/sqlcmd/sqlcmd-utility?view\=sql-server-ver16&tabs\=go%2Clinux&pivots\=cs1-bash>https\://learn.microsoft.com/ru-ru/sql/tools/sqlcmd/sqlcmd-utility?view\=sql-server-ver16&tabs\=go%2Clinux&pivots\=cs1-bash</>\n<link https\://github.com/microsoft/go-sqlcmd/releases/latest>https\://github.com/microsoft/go-sqlcmd/releases/latest</>\n
Item.ДекорацияОсобенностиРаботыtool1cd.Title=Table sizes are obtained using the <b>ctool1cd</> utility\nThe utility is included with the tools.\n\n
Item.ДекорацияОсобенностиРаботыБезПолученияРазмеров.Title=Table sizes are not obtained and the corresponding columns are not displayed
Item.ДекорацияОсобенностиРаботыПлатформенногоМетода.Title=There is no way to get the sizes of platform tables, as well as auxiliary table data (indexes, etc.)\nThe entire size of the metadata object data, including table parts, is displayed for the main table\n\nThe method does not take into account the size of the data history, as well as configuration extensions. \n
